		{ "Your PlayStation Network account", "Ton compte PlayStation Network" },
		{ "The console only accepts the account signed in on it. Mac'n'Play needs its identifier, which it gets by connecting to PSN.", "La console n'accepte que le compte connecté dessus. Mac'n'Play a besoin de son identifiant, qu'il obtient en se connectant au PSN." },
